1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,120
一二三四
One, two, three, four.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,260
跳个步 二二三四
And skip, two, three, four.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,340
转个圈 三二三四
And turn, two, three, four.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,860
我不喜欢这一段
I don't like this part.

5
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,420
没事宝贝 墙上找个点盯住
Well, honey, if you spot the wall,

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,440
就不会头晕了 爸秀给你看 好吗
then you won't get dizzy. Here, watch daddy, okay?

7
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,500
你说你要是
How cool would it be

8
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,100
转着转着就变身神奇女侠得有多酷
if you turned into Wonder Woman right now?

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,180
别跟我提这茬
Can't even talk about it.

10
00:00:20,517 --> 00:00:21,920
是领养中心打来的
Oh, it's the adoption agency.

11
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,440
我的妈呀 有信吗 有戏吗
Oh, my gosh. It is?! It is?! It is?!

12
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,940
小卡 别总跟打了鸡血似的
Cam, you need to stop doing that.

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,920
上次他们打来不过是确认账单地址而已
Last time, they were just calling To confirm our billing address.

14
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:27,480
你好
Hello?

15
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,340
-是吗 -"是"什么啊
- Uh-huh. - "Uh-huh" What?

16
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:30,140
好的
Yep.

17
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,400
-真的吗 -什么"真的"啊
- Really? - "Really" What?

18
00:00:32,489 --> 00:00:35,300
那个住在卡莱克西科的孕妇选中了我们
That--that mother from CAlexico, she picked us.

19
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:35,880
真的吗
She did?

20
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,140
她预产期提前 今天就要生了
She--she went into early labor. She's having the baby today.

21
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:39,980
真的吗
She is?!

22
00:00:40,124 --> 00:00:42,420
我们得马上赶往卡莱克西科
We have to go to CAlexico right now.

23
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,800
-真的吗 -全是真话你就别做惊讶状了
- We do?! - Just assume everything I say is the truth.

24
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:45,620
好吧
Okay, yeah.

25
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,000
行 没问题 好的
Okay. Oh, okay, yes.

26
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,440
太感谢你了 好 再见
Well , thank you so much. Okay, bye.

27
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,380
咱今天就能带个新娃回家了
Um... we're getting a baby today.

28
00:00:53,391 --> 00:00:56,932
我的亲娘耶 我的七舅老爷耶
Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh! We're...

29
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,300
等等 莉莉的表演会怎么办
Wait, wait, wait. What do we do about Lily's recital?

30
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:04,000
那啥 我们先让她坐稳了
Um... well, you know what? We'll--we'll just sit her down.

31
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:06,180
先晓之以理 再用冰棒动之以情
We'll--we'll tell her. We'll-- we'll give her a popsicle.

32
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:06,940
她能理解的
She'll be fine.

33
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:08,560
我们必须得赶过去
We have to do this.

34
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,560
好吧 你说得对
Okay, okay. Yeah, you're right

35
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,440
这样吧 我先去把旧婴儿车座找出来
Um, all right, I'm gonna go dig up the old car seat.

36
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,960
听着 咱们先
And listen, let's just...

37
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,980
深呼吸缓一缓 别急着奔走相告好吗
take a deep breath before we tell anyone, okay?

38
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:16,093
好
Yeah.

39
00:01:16,763 --> 00:01:19,360
杰 曼尼 天大的喜事
Jay! Manny! Good news!

40
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,860
米奇和小卡今天要领养一个新宝宝了
Mitch and Cam are getting a new baby today!

41
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,040
真的吗 真是大好事啊
Really? That's fantastic.

42
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,999
是个拉丁宝宝哦
And it's latino!

43
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:27,063
国界线上那些栅栏也没起多大作用嘛
How's that giant fence working out for ya?

44
00:01:29,580 --> 00:01:30,200
是克莱尔
It's Claire.

45
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:31,800
喂
Hello?

46
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:33,680
你听说了吗
Did you hear?

47
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,080
克莱尔 你好呀
Hey, Claire.

48
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,420
你们这就要开去某个加州边境小镇
You are driving to some California border town

49
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:41,840
领新宝宝了 我却才从歌洛莉亚那知道这事
to adopt a baby, and I have to hear about it from Gloria?

50
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,180
我就出去了两分钟
I was outside for two minutes.

51
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,940
人家已经忍耐到极限了
I kept it in as long as I could.

52
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,820
俺们家要来新宝宝了
We're having a baby!

53
00:02:02,069 --> 00:02:03,780
-这是什么啊 -搞毛啊
- What the heck is that? - What?!

54
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:04,820
我们回来了
We're back.

55
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,380
艾丽克斯买到了最萌的毕业舞会裙
We got Alex the cutest prom dress.

56
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:07,900
给你爹开开眼
Show your dad.

57
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,440
这拉链怎么一路开到胯下 我不喜欢
Well, I don't like how far down that zipper goes,

58
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,140
但要说优点的话 它貌似挺防水的
but on the plus side, it looks water-resistant.

59
00:02:13,962 --> 00:02:15,560
真不敢相信海莉不去舞会
I can't believe Haley's not going

60
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,940
要去的是艾丽克斯
to the prom and Alex is.

61
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,560
你这话什么意思
What's that supposed to mean?

62
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,160
虽然不知说了多少遍 不过海莉你真应该去
I know I keep saying it, Haley, but you should be going.

63
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,420
这可是你青葱岁月里浓墨重彩的一刻
It's a major moment in a teenager's life,

64
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,280
你正眼睁睁看它溜走
And you're missing it.

65
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,043
毕业舞会最没劲
Proms are lame.

66
00:02:25,043 --> 00:02:27,006
一群书呆子找借口打扮得花枝招展
It's just an excuse for dressed up dorks

67
00:02:27,006 --> 00:02:29,200
以便坐加长礼车 互相乱搞罢了
to ride in limos and hump each other.

68
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:32,140
是吗 现在我倒有点不想让艾丽克斯去了
Okay. Now I don't like the idea of Alex going.

69
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:34,200
亲爱的 没事 她可是艾丽克斯啊
Sweetie, I think we're fine. It's--it's Alex.

70
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,360
你这话又是什么意思
What's that supposed to mean?

71
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:36,800
意思是你就一宅女
It means you're a geek.

72
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,500
好吧 告诉你们
You know what? You know what?

73
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,780
我今夜没准也要放纵一把
I might just go crazy tonight

74
00:02:39,966 --> 00:02:42,331
跟某人耳鬓厮磨什么的
And--and--and hook up all over him.

75
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:44,020
好吧
Okay.

76
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,480
你们笑个屁啊 有什么好笑的
Why are you laughing? That's not funny.

77
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,701
我今晚连眼镜都不会带
I'm not even gonna wear my glasses!

78
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,560
看来是不用操心了
I feel better now.

79
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:52,460
好了 我要去商场了
All right, I'm going to the mall.

80
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:57,400
我们得谈一谈 宝贝
Um, we need to talk, honey.

81
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,040
我们很担心你
We're worried about you.

82
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:02,880
自从大学把你列入候补名单以后 就音信全无
You haven't heard back from the college that wait-listed you,

83
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,320
而你的其他朋友都收到了回复
and all the rest of your friends have.

84
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,180
现在你每天都在商场里打发时间
And now you're just wasting time at the mall.

85
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,660
权当知会你们一声
For your information,

86
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:09,360
我的社区大学申请表格
I've already filled out and dropped off

87
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,960
已经填好并寄出了
my community college application.

88
00:03:11,140 --> 00:03:12,200
另外呢
And plus also

89
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:14,640
我去商场是因为我有个工作面试
I'm going to the mall because I have a job interview.

90
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:16,740
-什么 -真的吗
- What? - Really?

91
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,240
我的指导顾问建议我给自己一年"空档"期
My guidance counselor suggested I take a gap year.

92
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:21,120
就是在高中毕业和上大学之前这段时间
You know, a year between high school and college

93
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,960
你可以上几门课 丰富一下生活阅历
where you take some courses, have some life experiences,

94
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,900
并从中汲取灵感
and get inspired.

95
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,760
所以这不 我就去GAP工作了
And obviously, work at the GAP.

96
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,280
搭建模型飞机第一步
The first step in plane building--

97
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:32,800
分门别类整理好
Organize the parts.

98
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,649
这边是动力装置 那边是机身
You got your power plant. You got your fuselage.

99
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:37,340
这一块是操纵界面
You got your control surfaces.

100
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,560
那是神马玩意
What's that?

101
00:03:38,976 --> 00:03:40,300
熟食拼盘
A charcuterie.

102
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,960
这边是熏火腿 那边是咸猪肉
You got your prosciutto, your pancetta,

103
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:42,680
这一块是腊肠
your salami.

104
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,580
这就是熟食拼盘吗
That's charcuterie?

105
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,980
这么多年来我每次点菜都回避它
I've been avoiding that on menus for years.

106
00:03:45,980 --> 00:03:48,136
起这么个破名字 谁还想要吃
They're killing themselves with that name.

107
00:03:48,300 --> 00:03:50,000
他们来了 他们来了
They're here! They're here!

108
00:03:53,656 --> 00:03:55,370
多谢你愿意帮我们 千谢万谢
Thank you so much for doing this. Thank you. Thank you.

109
00:03:55,370 --> 00:03:57,930
-别客气 -好 表演会6点开始
- Of course. - Okay, so her recital's at 6:00.

110
00:03:57,930 --> 00:04:00,480
-好 -这是地址和她的演出服
- Okay. - That's the address. Here's her outfit.

111
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,520
这是我们的摄像机
This is our camcorder.

112
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:03,380
麻烦录下整场演出 还有幕后花絮
Get the whole show and some backstage color.

113
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:04,944
各位 要带上熟食拼盘在路上吃吗
Guys, you wanna take our charcuterie for the road?

114
00:04:04,944 --> 00:04:07,043
不不不不 他们不用 我们自己吃吧
Bup, bup, bup, bup. They're good. We may need that.

115
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:08,300
喂
Hello?

116
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,800
是的
Yeah, um...

117
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,140
请稍等
H-hold on one second.

118
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:14,080
应该是宝宝的家人 他们在说西班牙语
I think it's the baby's family. They're speaking Spanish. I--

119
00:04:14,341 --> 00:04:16,974
你好 我是卡梅隆 有事吗
HOLA, SOY CAMERON. OMO ESTA?

120
00:04:17,737 --> 00:04:19,210
不好意思 麻烦你
Uh, b--excuse me. Could you s--

121
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:21,160
麻烦你说慢点
Could you slow down just a little bit?

122
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:23,260
"疯男迭戈"是什么意思
What does frenetico mean?

123
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,715
-就是 -让她接电话好了
- It's when... - Or just let her do it.

124
00:04:24,715 --> 00:04:27,050
-就这样 你来讲 -喂
- Yeah. There you go. Okay. - Hello?

125
00:04:27,179 --> 00:04:28,960
是 是
Si, si.

126
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,940
我说得好好的
I was doing fine.

127
00:04:30,300 --> 00:04:31,600
他以为自己是个专家了
He thinks he's some sort of an expert

128
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,100
就因为这两周来 他一直在看
because for the past two weeks, he's been watching

129
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:34,780
一部荒诞的西班牙语肥皂剧
this ridiculous Spanish soap opera.

130
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:35,300
《水生火热》吗
"Fire and ice"?

131
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:37,380
千万别把昨晚的大结局剧透了
Don't say a word about the ending of last night's episode.

132
00:04:37,751 --> 00:04:39,637
歌洛莉亚看那剧 剧透就全毁了
G-gloria watches that. You'll ruin it.

133
00:04:39,637 --> 00:04:43,220
好的好的 谢谢
Si. Muchisimas gracias.

134
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,500
是孩子的姨妈 胡安妮塔
It was the mother's sister Juanita.

135
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:48,520
她说她还不知道是哪所医院
She said that she doesn't know the exact hospital yet,

136
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:50,740
但是她大概一小时后会再打给你
but that she will call you, like, in the next hour.

137
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:52,760
谢谢 歌洛莉亚 我想麻烦你帮个忙
Oh, thank you, Gloria. I-I hate to ask this of you,

138
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:54,300
你能和我们一起去吗
but would you mind coming with us?

139
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,280
我们需要个真正会说西班牙语的人
We need someone who actually knows how to speak Spanish.

140
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,100
我的心拔凉拔凉的
Frio. Muy frio.

141
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:01,780
好啊 当然可以啦 谢谢 谢谢
Ay, yes, of course! I would love to! Thank you! Thank you!

142
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:03,900
我这就去收拾东西 然后就出发 好吗
I'm gonna grab my stuff, and we go, okay?

143
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,800
好了 宝贝 快过来
All right, sweetheart. All right, come here.

144
00:05:06,181 --> 00:05:08,107
爸爸要出发了
Daddies gotta go, okay?

145
00:05:08,107 --> 00:05:10,480
宝贝 抱歉不能看你表演了
Okay, we're so sorry we're missing your recital, sweetie.

146
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,020
但是你知道吗
But you know what?

147
00:05:11,020 --> 00:05:13,177
你马上就会多个刚出生的弟弟啦
You're getting a brand-new baby brother!

148
00:05:13,177 --> 00:05:14,241
快走吧 快走吧
Cam, come on. Come on.

149
00:05:14,241 --> 00:05:15,517
好的 好的 深呼吸 深呼吸
Okay. All right, breathe, breathe, breathe.

150
00:05:15,517 --> 00:05:18,573
再见杰 再见曼尼 回头见啦
Ciao, Jay! Ciao, Manny! I see you later, okay?

151
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:21,620
这是怎么一回事
What just happened here?

152
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:23,460
我要上厕所
I have to go to the bathroom.

153
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,825
-她是跟你说话 -要不你来管吧
- She's talking to you. - You wanna take that?

154
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,520
首先脚步一定要跟上节奏
Always keep the rhythm in your feet.

155
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:32,760
然后肩膀上再加点花活 懂吗
Then we're gonna add just a little party in the shoulders. All right?

156
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,460
再来点手臂动作
Now let's get those arms going.

157
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,240
不 不 不 手放下面是在说
No, no, no. Arms down here says,

158
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,260
"哥是白人 对不起"
"I'm white and I'm sorry,"

159
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,140
但手举起来是表示
But arms up here says,

160
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,340
"哥很神秘 猜不透"
"You don't know what I am."

161
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:41,382
的确猜不透
I-I don't.

162
00:05:41,780 --> 00:05:43,320
你们不会相信的
You're never gonna believe it!

163
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,300
你们不会相信的
You're never gonna believe it!

164
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:45,500
你们不会相信的
You're never gonna believe it!

165
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,580
猜猜谁找到工作了 是我
Guess who got a job! I did!

166
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,100
哎呀 包袱抖早了
Oh, shoot. I just told you.

167
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:51,660
-亲爱的 恭喜你 -太棒了
- Oh! Honey, congratulations! - That's amazing!

168
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:52,580
你找到工作了
You got a job!

169
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:53,901
这是些什么
And what is all this?

170
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,220
我路过杂货店 就买了点菜做晚饭
I stopped by the grocery store to get some stuff for dinner.

171
00:05:56,940 --> 00:05:58,220
你知道杂货店在哪儿吗
You know where the grocery store is?

172
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,320
我知道 老妈
Yes, mother.

173
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:02,020
