Are you sad your dads aren't here?

348
00:13:20,540 --> 00:13:22,920
是啊 他们也会因为错过这个而伤心
Yeah. Well, I know they're sad to miss this,

349
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:25,100
但他们去接你的小弟弟了
But they're getting you that baby brother.

350
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:26,340
这是好事 对吧
That's good, right?

351
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,780
你知道的 亲爱的
You know, honey,

352
00:13:31,318 --> 00:13:34,000
你两个爸爸还是会一样爱你的
Your dads are gonna love you just as much

353
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,000
小弟弟来了也不会变 相信我
when you get this brother. Trust me.

354
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,680
我先有了你克莱尔姑姑 然后你爸出生了
I first had your Aunt Claire, and then your dad came along,

355
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,760
我对他们都的爱都一样深
and I loved them just the same,

356
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:42,140
虽然你爹可能不这么说
no matter what he tells you.

357
00:13:42,531 --> 00:13:43,567
你相信我吗
You believe me?

358
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:45,980
这就够了
Close enough.

359
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,120
你说呢
So what do you say?

360
00:13:47,279 --> 00:13:49,247
你会上去跳舞给大家看吗
You gonna go out there and dance for everybody?

361
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:49,980
不
No.

362
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:54,520
亲爱的 我总能干点什么让你上台的吧
Honey, there must be something I can do to get you out there.

363
00:13:55,724 --> 00:13:57,247
来跟我一起跳 爷爷
Come dance with me, grandpa.

364
00:13:57,247 --> 00:13:58,568
不 亲爱的 这是不可能滴
No, honey, that's not gonna happen.

365
00:13:58,660 --> 00:13:59,760
我给你五十块钱咋样
How about I give you 50 bucks?

366
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,700
我不理解为什么我就不能这样做
I don't see why I can't do this.

367
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,480
我完全有能力掌控自己的人生
I'm totally getting my life together.

368
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,140
请允许我给你
Uh, allow me, if you will,

369
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:08,560
准确描绘一下你以为自己想要的生活
to paint an accurate picture of this life

370
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:09,504
是什么样的 好吗
Yeah. You think you want, okay?

371
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,900
起初 分分钟妙不可言
Um, at first, it's a blast--

372
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:13,280
去买个餐盘架
buying a dish rack,

373
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:16,300
挂个床单 把房间一分为二
hanging a sheet up to turn one room into two.

374
00:14:16,350 --> 00:14:18,371
用通用扳手捣鼓出个"四不像"书柜
Allen-wrenching a bookcase called a nurnk...

375
00:14:18,371 --> 00:14:20,225
因为你连宜家的组装货的买不起
because you couldn't afford the sklurg.

376
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:22,140
接下来呢
But then...

377
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:25,040
账单源源不断地涌进来
Then those bills start rolling in...

378
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:26,473
这样你就不得不多轮几班
Oh. So you gotta pick up some extra shifts.

379
00:14:26,473 --> 00:14:27,595
对 然后猛不丁的
Yeah. And suddenly...

380
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:29,880
这是啥啊 你怀孕了
Uh-oh, what's that? You're pregnant.

381
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:30,780
早该注意的
Should've been safe.

382
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:33,056
弄得你焦头烂额 精疲力尽
Ooh, and you're stressed and exhausted.

383
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:36,340
车库里装满了卖不出去的T恤衫
You've got a garage filled with unsold huge t-shirts.

384
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,180
还有 亲爱的 如果你觉得这种压力
And, honey, if you think this kind of stress

385
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:41,400
还不足以对你的身材长相造成任何影响
is not gonna take its toll on that body and that face,

386
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,440
再想想吧
think again.

387
00:14:42,453 --> 00:14:45,594
好皮肤只能再见
Good-bye, beautiful skin.

388
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:47,360
如丝般秀发也永别了
Farewell, silky hair.

389
00:14:47,648 --> 00:14:49,567
就等着穿艾丽克斯给你的旧衣服吧
And hello, Alex's hand-me-downs,

390
00:14:49,576 --> 00:14:51,169
因为商店里的你是买不起了
'cause you can't afford to shop.

391
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,840
这针见"血"了
Good one.

392
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,805
你觉得这行得通吗
Do you think that this is gonna work out?

393
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:58,500
能啊
Yes.

394
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:00,840
我说的是我爹妈那边
Well, for my parents, I mean.

395
00:15:01,220 --> 00:15:01,840
至于你嘛
For you?

396
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,060
不能
No.

397
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:04,820
天呐
God.

398
00:15:05,184 --> 00:15:08,375
我真的太想跟海莉一块生活了
I just wanna live with Haley so bad.

399
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,900
我在怀俄明那么长时间 没办法和她在一起
It's like, I missed all this time with her in Wyoming.

400
00:15:12,412 --> 00:15:15,120
现在回来了她又要去上大学 我怕失去她
Then I thought I was gonna lose her again to college.

401
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:17,840
别担心 我罩着你 有我在就不可能
Don't worry. I got your back, buddy. That's not gonna happen.

402
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,560
你那是什么意思
What does that mean?

403
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,920
迪兰 把门关上
Dylan, shut the door.

404
00:15:26,020 --> 00:15:27,740
卧室的门
The bedroom door.

405
00:15:33,309 --> 00:15:34,407
抱歉 抱歉
Excuse me. Excuse me.

406
00:15:34,407 --> 00:15:35,380
那个
Okay.

407
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:36,640
我们非常困惑
We're very confused.

408
00:15:36,740 --> 00:15:38,560
能有人告诉我们到底发生什么事了吗
Can somebody please just tell us what's happening?

409
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:41,300
有人跟祖母说了宝宝的事
Somebody told the grandmother about the baby,

410
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,900
她本来不该知道的
and she wasn't supposed to know.

411
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:45,960
要我说 是那迷死人的神父说的
If you ask me, it was the sexy priest.

412
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:47,020
够了
Enough!

413
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,140
不是神父
It wasn't the priest.

414
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:50,700
是我
It was me.

415
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:51,140
爱德华多
Eduardo!

416
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:54,380
到底咋回事
What's happening?

417
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,460
是的 我还活着
Yes, I am alive.

418
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,640
没错 我是个放羊的
And I may be just a ranch hand,

419
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:01,020
但是我告诉了你祖母孩子的事
but I'm the one that told your abuela about the baby.

420
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:03,720
我告诉她是因为我向你母亲发过誓
I told her because I swore to your mother

421
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,840
要照顾你们家人
to look after your family.

422
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,420
你的母亲
Your mother...

423
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:07,760
是我的情人
was my lover.

424
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,480
等一下 我现在得把英文翻成成西语
Ay, wait a minute. Now I go from English to Spanish.

425
00:16:13,024 --> 00:16:16,140
我们现在能见宝宝了吗
C-can we please just see our baby?

426
00:16:16,140 --> 00:16:16,820
不能
No!

427
00:16:18,659 --> 00:16:20,208
-祖母 -祖母
- Abuela? - Abuela?

428
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:34,940
她说她要抚养孩子长大
She's saying that she's going to raise the baby.

429
00:16:37,060 --> 00:16:38,020
不是吧
No.

430
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:39,300
小卡
Cam.

431
00:16:42,426 --> 00:16:43,837
过来 过来
Come here. Come on.

432
00:16:46,700 --> 00:16:48,980
你猜怎么的 突然间你就已经六十岁了
Guess what? Suddenly, you're 60 years old,

433
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:52,340
牙都掉光了 在一块不毛之地上瞎晃悠
wandering toothless and alone in a postapocalyptic wasteland.

434
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:55,020
等一下 迪兰是怎么拿到核武器代码来着
Wait a second. How did Dylan get the nuclear codes again?

435
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:56,080
在机器人战争的时候
During the robot wars.

436
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,540
好了 我想你爸有点
Okay, I think your father might have gotten

437
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:00,220
扯太远了 亲爱的 重点是
a little bit off-track here. Honey, listen, the point is,

438
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,700
你今天所做的一切决定
The choices you make today--

439
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:02,640
不 重点是
No, no, the point is,

440
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:04,760
事情不一定非要向坏的方向发展
is that it doesn't have to turn out so bad.

441
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,000
她说的对
She's right.

442
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:08,780
不一定 卢克
It doesn't. Luke?

443
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:10,140
昨天寄来的
This came yesterday.

444
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:11,080
是什么
What is it?

445
00:17:11,340 --> 00:17:12,540
是那大学寄来的
It's from that college.

446
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,260
你被录取了 海莉
You got in, Haley.

447
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:15,240
-迪... -我的天
- Oh, D-- - Oh, my god.

448
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,820
-你被大学录取了 -什么
- You got into college? - What?!

449
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:19,290
太好了
That's amazing!

450
00:17:20,900 --> 00:17:22,790
是昨天寄来的
It came yest-- yesterday?

451
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,780
卢克 你为什么要藏起来
Luke, why were you hiding this?

452
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,340
不知道
I don't know.

453
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:28,220
你不想让她去上大学吗
Do you not want her to go to college?

454
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,140
我不关心
I don't care.

455
00:17:29,140 --> 00:17:31,340
你会想我的
Aw! You're gonna miss me!

456
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:34,580
闭嘴 我才不会 再也不告诉你任何事了
Shut up! I am not! I'm never telling you anything again.

457
00:17:34,580 --> 00:17:37,903
抱歉 小兄弟 但大学她还是得去上的
Sorry, little dude, but she's gotta go to college,

458
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:40,620
哪怕这意味着她不能和我同居
Even if that means that she can't live with me.

459
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:41,720
迪兰
Oh, Dylan.

460
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,900
不过你能答应我一件事吗
Could you do one thing for me, though?

461
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,420
能让我陪你去参加毕业舞会吗
Could you take me to your prom?

462
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:49,300
-你真的想吗 -是啊
- Really? - Yeah.

463
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:52,300
如果你去上大学 不再回来了
I mean, if you go off to college and you don't come back here,

464
00:17:52,340 --> 00:17:53,740
我希望你能记住我
I want you to remember me.

465
00:17:53,816 --> 00:17:56,347
我要做你的安吉拉·威尔金斯
I wanna be your Angela Wilkins.

466
00:17:57,840 --> 00:17:58,920
-妈 -什么事
- Mom? - Yes.

467
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,960
我说你老得不能穿的那条紫色裙子
Can I borrow that purple dress I said you were

468
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:01,580
能借我吗
too old for?

469
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:04,200
你可真会借东西 好吧
Mm, in spite of that, yeah. Yeah.

470
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,240
邓先生
Mr. D.

471
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:09,420
你有没有礼服可以借我的
Do you have a tuxedo I could borrow?

472
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:11,980
当然有 这可是我的结婚礼服
Yeah, sure. I mean, it's the tux I got married in,

473
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:12,820
是双排扣的[两块胸肌]
So it's double-breasted.

474
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:15,800
太好了 我也是
Perfect. So am I.

475
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:17,680
好吧
Okay.

476
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:26,160
我去买点吃的垫垫肚子
I'm going to get something for my stomach.

477
00:18:30,933 --> 00:18:32,743
快刷呀
Oh, come on, swipe.

478
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,120
刷呀
Swipe!

479
00:18:34,132 --> 00:18:35,882
米奇尔 来帮我一下
M-mitchell, I need your help.

480
00:18:36,620 --> 00:18:39,740
刷不了 我现在也没心情"找收银员"
It won't swipe, and I'm in no condition to "See cashier."

481
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:40,700
米奇尔
Mitchell.

482
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:42,240
米奇尔
Mitchell.

483
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:43,620
米奇尔
Mitchell?

484
00:18:43,620 --> 00:18:46,742
米奇 米奇尔 你去哪里啊
Mitch--Mitchell! Where are you going?!

485
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:48,840
我受够了 小卡
I'm just sick of it, Cam.

486
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:50,860
米奇尔 回来我们聊聊
Mitchell, come back here and talk to me.

487
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:53,860
这里有土狼 还有吸毒的
There are coyotes out here and--and meth addicts!

488
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,120
小卡 每一次
Every time, Cam.

489
00:18:55,504 --> 00:18:57,880
每一次有人说我们能领养个孩子
Every time someone says that we're getting a-a baby,

490
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,620
我都寄以希望
I get my hopes up and then...

491
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:01,503
却总是以失望而告终 我...
And then when it all falls apart, I...

492
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:03,880
我们又得从头到尾再经历一遍
We just have to go through the whole thing again.

493
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:06,080
但同时 我们已经拥有的孩子
And then meanwhile, the child that we do have

494
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:08,713
正在演出 但我们却错过了
is--is at a recital, and--and we're missing it.

495
00:19:08,732 --> 00:19:09,748
我知道
I know.

496
00:19:10,820 --> 00:19:12,920
我和你一样沮丧
I'm as frustrated as you are.

497
00:19:13,191 --> 00:19:15,840
是吗 因为我不
Are you? Because I-I don't--

498
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:18,280
我不知道我还能承受多少次
I don't know how much more of this I can take.

499
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:20,246
我心力憔悴
I am--I am so tired

500
00:19:21,124 --> 00:19:22,870
失望透顶
and--and just disappointed.

501
00:19:25,085 --> 00:19:27,181
累到无以复加
And... I'm just tired.

502
00:19:34,585 --> 00:19:35,842
那我们缓缓吧
Then let's take a break.

503
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:37,400
真的吗
Really?

504
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:39,900
我们俩一直这样撑着
It must be exhausting,

505
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:42,400
肯定已经精疲力竭了
always keeping it together for the both of us.

506
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:51,660
我也累了
And I'm tired, too.

507
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,920
我觉得我躺在块石头上了
I think I'm lying on a rock.

508
00:19:57,260 --> 00:19:58,720
我躺在我的"磐石"旁边
I'm lying next to my rock.

509
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:04,920
人一辈子 有些时刻是永远无法忘怀的
There's certain moments in life that you never forget,

510
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:10,400
比如说我第一次将曼尼拥入怀中
Like when I held Manny in my arms for the very first time.

511
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:16,720
我很紧张 我不知所措
I was nervous. I didn't know what I was doing.

512
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:18,820
怎么样
What do you think?

513
00:20:18,933 --> 00:20:21,829
-俊男靓女啊 -我们的宝贝女儿
- You guys look amazing. - Oh, our little girl!

514
00:20:21,829 --> 00:20:24,030
看到他的成长让我兴奋不已
And I was excited to see him grow up.

515
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:25,361
-拜拜 宝贝 -玩得开心
- Bye, sweetie. - Have fun, man.

516
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:26,580
她睡着了
She's asleep.

517
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,780
跟你说孩子 我老得没法当爹了
I tell you, kid, I'm too old for this.

518
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:31,040
我们都是
You and me both.

519
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:34,320
随着他慢慢成长为今天的小大人模样
And the more he becomes the little man I know today,

520
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:39,240
我越来越意识到自己愿意重来一次
the more I know I would do it all over again...

521
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:43,760
正好 因为我真的要重来一次
Which is good, because I'm going to do it all over again.

522
00:20:44,134 --> 00:20:46,223
原来我不是晕车
Turns out that I wasn't carsick.

523
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,560
我怀孕了
I'm pregnant.

524
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:53,800
卢克
Okay, Luke,

525
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:56,640
-看看你还藏了些什么 -好吧
- Let's see what else you've been hiding from us. - Okay, fine.

526
00:20:57,112 --> 00:20:59,440
这是我在牧场炸掉的鸟窝的罚单
Here's a bill for the birdhouse I blew up at the dude ranch.

527
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,320
你炸了个鸟窝
You blew up a birdhouse?

528
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:02,220
说完了再一起问吧
Let's hold all questions until the end.

529
00:21:02,501 --> 00:21:04,011
这是我们去迪士尼那天
Here's dad's jury duty thing

530
00:21:04,011 --> 00:21:05,672
通知老爸做陪审员的
for the day we went to disneyland.

